1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 15=

2
00:01:13,580 --> 00:01:15,020
Detective Inspector Ding, I've checked.

3
00:01:15,020 --> 00:01:17,420
Boss Lv definitely
isn't hiding at Kaimeili.

4
00:01:17,420 --> 00:01:19,020
Only the boss lady, Long Feng,

5
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:20,140
is keeping the place running.

6
00:01:21,460 --> 00:01:23,180
Keep watching Kaimeili.

7
00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:26,060
Report back if you hear anything.

8
00:01:26,380 --> 00:01:28,700
What if we really can't find Boss Lv?

9
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:29,820
I'm worried that
causing all this trouble

10
00:01:29,820 --> 00:01:30,620
might...

11
00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:33,340
These are Boss Ren's orders.

12
00:01:34,220 --> 00:01:35,620
If we don't put pressure on them,

13
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:37,220
how will we find Lv Mengde?

14
00:01:37,580 --> 00:01:38,940
Understood. We'll follow your orders.

15
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:52,100
Keep watching the front
and back entrances.

16
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:52,780
Yes, sir.

17
00:02:21,060 --> 00:02:22,100
Driver, hurry up!

18
00:02:22,300 --> 00:02:22,980
Faster!

19
00:02:22,980 --> 00:02:23,740
Faster!

20
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:35,300
Thank you.

21
00:02:40,100 --> 00:02:40,900
All right.

22
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:49,640
(St. Luke's Hospital)

23
00:03:08,980 --> 00:03:09,780
Who are you looking for?

24
00:03:10,820 --> 00:03:12,300
This is a private hospital room.

25
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:13,500
What are you doing here?

26
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:14,180
I...

27
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:15,660
Miss!

28
00:03:15,660 --> 00:03:16,580
Are you all right?

29
00:03:16,620 --> 00:03:18,300
Let's get you onto a hospital bed.

30
00:03:18,420 --> 00:03:19,620
I'm not feeling very well.

31
00:03:19,620 --> 00:03:20,860
Lie down and rest for a while.

32
00:03:20,860 --> 00:03:22,180
I'll get a doctor.

33
00:03:22,380 --> 00:03:23,020
There's no need.

34
00:03:23,020 --> 00:03:24,620
I'll just rest here for a while.

35
00:03:24,620 --> 00:03:25,620
I'm afraid not.

36
00:03:25,660 --> 00:03:26,640
In your current condition,

37
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:27,520
if something happens after you leave,

38
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:29,140
we can't have you blaming the hospital.

39
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,500
I won't.

40
00:03:30,620 --> 00:03:31,860
Please change into
this hospital gown first.

41
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:33,140
I'll get a doctor.

42
00:03:47,780 --> 00:03:50,060
Sir, this area is for
free medical consultations.

43
00:03:50,060 --> 00:03:51,620
Please go to the outpatient clinic
for treatment.

44
00:03:51,620 --> 00:03:52,460
Have you seen a woman

45
00:03:52,460 --> 00:03:54,100
in a yellow trench coat come in?

46
00:03:54,100 --> 00:03:55,060
Who are you?

47
00:03:55,060 --> 00:03:56,060
What are you trying to do?

48
00:03:56,380 --> 00:03:57,180
Let me see that.

49
00:03:57,500 --> 00:03:58,300
What are you doing?

50
00:03:58,380 --> 00:03:59,340
I just want to take a look.

51
00:03:59,660 --> 00:04:01,780
Someone's causing trouble
and snatching things!

52
00:04:02,460 --> 00:04:04,180
No, thank you.

53
00:04:04,220 --> 00:04:05,300
- Thank you. Thank you.
- You!

54
00:04:05,300 --> 00:04:05,700
Excuse me.

55
00:04:05,940 --> 00:04:06,580
Hey, you!

56
00:04:09,980 --> 00:04:10,820
Stop!

57
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:29,780
Come quickly!

58
00:04:29,780 --> 00:04:30,900
Someone's causing trouble over here!

59
00:04:46,820 --> 00:04:48,020
You really haven't changed.

60
00:04:48,220 --> 00:04:49,380
You're still so afraid
of seeing a doctor.

61
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:51,300
That's not true.

62
00:04:51,460 --> 00:04:52,780
This hospital gown is so old-fashioned.

63
00:04:52,900 --> 00:04:54,020
It has absolutely no shape.

64
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:55,220
I won't look good in it.

65
00:04:56,020 --> 00:04:57,100
Just let me go home first

66
00:04:57,620 --> 00:04:58,860
to get some clothes to change into.

67
00:04:58,860 --> 00:04:59,620
Please?

68
00:04:59,780 --> 00:05:00,620
You're so beautiful.

69
00:05:00,660 --> 00:05:02,100
You look good in anything.

70
00:05:02,180 --> 00:05:04,500
Even in a hospital gown,

71
00:05:05,220 --> 00:05:06,620
you'd still be the prettiest one here.

72
00:05:09,180 --> 00:05:10,060
Please step outside.

73
00:05:10,060 --> 00:05:10,860
I'll take care of her.

74
00:05:16,100 --> 00:05:16,900
Go ahead and change.

75
00:05:24,980 --> 00:05:26,780
How did your injuries get even worse?

76
00:05:27,540 --> 00:05:28,420
Regretting it now?

77
00:05:28,420 --> 00:05:29,580
Holy Mother Mary.

78
00:05:30,820 --> 00:05:32,260
I told you before.

79
00:05:34,140 --> 00:05:35,380
My life isn't worth much.

80
00:05:36,460 --> 00:05:38,380
Don't waste your time on me.

81
00:05:38,380 --> 00:05:39,180
Stop right there!

82
00:05:40,820 --> 00:05:41,620
That's him!

83
00:05:41,940 --> 00:05:42,980
He just tried to snatch
my medical records

84
00:05:42,980 --> 00:05:43,900
and barged into the patient rooms.

85
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:45,220
I'm not here to cause trouble.

86
00:05:45,220 --> 00:05:46,340
I'm a patient's family member.

87
00:05:46,340 --> 00:05:47,260
I'm looking for someone.

88
00:05:47,260 --> 00:05:48,700
Who are you looking for? Seize him!

89
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:51,780
Let go!

90
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:54,060
See this?

91
00:05:54,060 --> 00:05:55,020
I'm with the police.

92
00:05:55,060 --> 00:05:56,180
Take a good look!

93
00:05:56,300 --> 00:05:57,660
So you're here on police business.

94
00:05:57,660 --> 00:05:58,660
What can we do to help?

95
00:05:58,660 --> 00:05:59,460
Mr. Ding.

96
00:06:02,140 --> 00:06:03,180
Guard the entrance.

97
00:06:03,220 --> 00:06:04,580
Don't let any women leave.

98
00:06:04,620 --> 00:06:05,260
Yes, sir.

99
00:06:06,180 --> 00:06:07,100
Quick!

100
00:06:10,260 --> 00:06:11,300
Where did you get these clothes?

101
00:06:12,020 --> 00:06:13,460
A patient changed out of them.

102
00:06:13,460 --> 00:06:14,100
Where is she?

103
00:06:14,100 --> 00:06:14,820
Take me to her.

104
00:06:14,820 --> 00:06:15,900
You can ask her,

105
00:06:15,900 --> 00:06:17,660
but don't upset her too much.

106
00:06:34,260 --> 00:06:35,060
What does she mean?

107
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:38,260
She asked me to ask God

108
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:39,900
if she could still go to heaven.

109
00:06:39,900 --> 00:06:41,420
Did she ask you about Yijie?

110
00:06:43,260 --> 00:06:45,340
Yijie looks much better now.

111
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:46,660
Don't worry, Madam.

112
00:06:46,660 --> 00:06:48,060
He'll get better.

113
00:06:48,940 --> 00:06:50,020
I'll be going now.

114
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:53,020
Dr. Bai examined him this morning.

115
00:06:53,420 --> 00:06:55,300
She said he's regaining consciousness

116
00:06:55,660 --> 00:06:57,580
and can already hear
what's happening around him.

117
00:06:57,900 --> 00:06:58,940
He might even know

118
00:06:58,940 --> 00:06:59,940
you're here.

119
00:07:00,300 --> 00:07:01,340
That's wonderful.

120
00:07:01,700 --> 00:07:03,380
You haven't slept in two days.

121
00:07:03,660 --> 00:07:04,980
You really need some rest.

122
00:07:05,140 --> 00:07:05,900
If there's anything

123
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:07,020
I can do to help,

124
00:07:07,020 --> 00:07:08,020
please tell me.

125
00:07:30,860 --> 00:07:31,460
What's wrong?

126
00:07:31,460 --> 00:07:32,260
Where's Kuang Yijie?

127
00:07:32,460 --> 00:07:33,260
In his hospital room.

128
00:07:33,260 --> 00:07:34,420
Is Mrs. Kuang in there too?

129
00:07:34,420 --> 00:07:35,300
She's been there the whole time.

130
00:07:37,060 --> 00:07:37,900
What exactly happened?

131
00:07:37,900 --> 00:07:38,260
Dr. Bai.

132
00:07:38,260 --> 00:07:39,260
Mr. Ding says

133
00:07:39,260 --> 00:07:40,540
Kuang Yijie may be in danger.

134
00:07:40,540 --> 00:07:42,100
Yijie!

135
00:07:42,460 --> 00:07:43,940
Doctor!

136
00:07:43,940 --> 00:07:44,940
What's wrong, Mrs. Kuang?

137
00:07:44,940 --> 00:07:45,620
Quick, save him!

138
00:07:45,620 --> 00:07:46,340
Please save him!

139
00:07:48,660 --> 00:07:49,660
He was fine just a moment ago.

140
00:07:49,660 --> 00:07:50,420
I turned away for a second,

141
00:07:50,420 --> 00:07:51,540
and suddenly he was like this.

142
00:07:52,340 --> 00:07:54,340
What's wrong?

143
00:07:56,420 --> 00:07:57,780
What's going on?

144
00:07:58,060 --> 00:07:59,220
What happened to him?

145
00:08:06,260 --> 00:08:06,780
This is...

146
00:08:07,500 --> 00:08:08,860
This is the one from the opium den.

147
00:08:08,940 --> 00:08:09,660
The Euphoria Injection.

148
00:08:09,780 --> 00:08:10,500
Euphoria Injection?

149
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:11,260
Cocaine.

150
00:08:11,500 --> 00:08:12,900
Get him to the emergency room now!

151
00:08:13,060 --> 00:08:14,860
Hurry!

152
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,600
(Operating Room)

153
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:01,620
How is Yijie?

154
00:09:54,020 --> 00:09:54,900
Yijie.

155
00:09:55,820 --> 00:09:57,060
Yijie, Mom's here.

156
00:09:58,900 --> 00:09:59,460
Yijie.

157
00:10:23,060 --> 00:10:24,700
Who's the killer?

158
00:10:26,460 --> 00:10:28,100
It was probably Long Feng.

159
00:10:28,100 --> 00:10:29,820
How did she know Yijie was here?

160
00:10:30,260 --> 00:10:31,580
She happened to ask about him,

161
00:10:32,020 --> 00:10:33,100
and I let my guard down.

162
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:34,100
Where is she now?

163
00:10:34,100 --> 00:10:34,980
It's too late.

164
00:10:38,420 --> 00:10:39,940
I had the entrances and exits sealed off

165
00:10:40,180 --> 00:10:41,500
and every hospital room searched,

166
00:10:41,660 --> 00:10:42,700
but we still couldn't find her.

167
00:10:45,140 --> 00:10:46,380
This person you're talking about,

168
00:10:46,740 --> 00:10:48,060
why would she want to kill my son?

169
00:10:49,860 --> 00:10:52,900
This is the Euphoria Injection
sold at Jinpeng Opium Den.

170
00:10:53,700 --> 00:10:54,740
Long Feng is the woman Lv Mengde

171
00:10:54,740 --> 00:10:56,380
brought back from Nanyang.

172
00:11:01,460 --> 00:11:02,580
They probably tried to kill Yijie

173
00:11:03,260 --> 00:11:05,020
to silence him,

174
00:11:05,620 --> 00:11:08,020
afraid he'd reveal the truth
behind Xiaozhu's death

175
00:11:08,060 --> 00:11:10,260
and the secrets of
the missing Black Cat girls.

176
00:11:12,340 --> 00:11:15,580
Lv Mengde...

177
00:11:17,220 --> 00:11:18,060
Black Cat...

178
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:18,520
(Mei Xiaozhu, Dong Zhenglun)

179
00:11:19,500 --> 00:11:20,340
Girls...

180
00:11:29,860 --> 00:11:30,660
Dr. Bai.

181
00:11:31,060 --> 00:11:33,340
Did you already know Long Feng?

182
00:11:37,460 --> 00:11:38,260
Yes.

183
00:11:39,060 --> 00:11:40,540
I once saved her life in Nanyang.

184
00:11:41,060 --> 00:11:42,460
But I assure you,

185
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:43,700
I'm a doctor.

186
00:11:43,740 --> 00:11:45,500
I would never help her kill anyone.

187
00:11:50,260 --> 00:11:50,890
Mrs. Kuang.

188
00:11:55,060 --> 00:11:55,860
Assure us?

189
00:11:56,300 --> 00:11:57,580
How can you possibly assure us?

190
00:11:57,860 --> 00:11:58,780
Save your assurances

191
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:00,820
for your God!

192
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:03,020
Get out! Get out of here!

193
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:04,940
Get out!

194
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:13,640
(Operating Room)

195
00:12:55,220 --> 00:12:56,740
Mr. Jing told me

196
00:12:57,460 --> 00:12:59,140
Boss Ren made you a detective inspector.

197
00:13:01,660 --> 00:13:03,260
So you've decided to work for him?

198
00:13:04,100 --> 00:13:05,500
Having authority is a good thing.

199
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:07,620
Now I finally understand

200
00:13:08,860 --> 00:13:10,420
what you meant about
all that wasted effort.

201
00:13:11,860 --> 00:13:13,500
Everything we did was for nothing,

202
00:13:14,820 --> 00:13:16,580
and Yijie paid the price.

203
00:13:17,100 --> 00:13:18,300
You didn't cause his death.

204
00:13:19,900 --> 00:13:21,180
He chose to trust you.

205
00:13:24,500 --> 00:13:25,860
He gave you the evidence

206
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:27,260
because he wanted to pass

207
00:13:27,260 --> 00:13:28,620
the responsibility
of uncovering the truth

208
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:29,740
on to you.

209
00:13:30,260 --> 00:13:31,300
Because he knew

210
00:13:31,660 --> 00:13:32,980
that in this world,

211
00:13:33,220 --> 00:13:35,500
you're the only one who, like him,

212
00:13:35,700 --> 00:13:38,260
would risk everything for Xiaozhu.

213
00:13:38,660 --> 00:13:40,140
But Xiaozhu is dead.

214
00:13:40,900 --> 00:13:42,260
Yijie is dead too.

215
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:50,420
What about those Black Cat girls?

216
00:13:51,740 --> 00:13:53,460
They might still be alive.

217
00:13:59,060 --> 00:14:00,060
I didn't expect

218
00:14:01,060 --> 00:14:02,740
you'd still want to investigate.

219
00:14:04,460 --> 00:14:05,860
You're no different.

220
00:14:08,820 --> 00:14:10,540
If you'd wanted to leave Shanghai,

221
00:14:10,540 --> 00:14:11,500
you would've left long ago.

222
00:14:11,900 --> 00:14:13,020
You're only talking this way

223
00:14:13,100 --> 00:14:14,500
to push me away

224
00:14:16,020 --> 00:14:17,420
so you can investigate on your own.

225
00:14:18,340 --> 00:14:19,140
I'm not.

226
00:14:24,260 --> 00:14:26,020
I saw you asking questions

227
00:14:26,660 --> 00:14:27,740
at the police station.

228
00:14:32,020 --> 00:14:34,420
These women are my friends.

229
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:36,780
They've been missing for a long time.

230
00:14:36,820 --> 00:14:37,660
Have you found them?

231
00:14:37,820 --> 00:14:38,700
What did you say?

232
00:14:38,860 --> 00:14:40,780
- Women? What women?
- Women.

233
00:14:41,020 --> 00:14:42,500
Women. Woman.

234
00:14:43,740 --> 00:14:46,140
In French, it's Femme.

235
00:14:46,140 --> 00:14:47,500
Missing. Missing.

236
00:14:48,660 --> 00:14:50,700
Why is this so difficult?

237
00:14:50,700 --> 00:14:52,260
Isn't this under your jurisdiction?

238
00:14:52,260 --> 00:14:53,500
The newspapers have already reported it.

239
00:14:53,740 --> 00:14:55,340
Whether they're alive or dead,

240
00:14:55,340 --> 00:14:56,780
you owe us an explanation, don't you?

241
00:14:57,380 --> 00:14:58,100
What's all this commotion?

242
00:14:58,100 --> 00:15:00,020
She keeps asking about some people.

243
00:15:00,140 --> 00:15:01,060
Women.

244
00:15:01,100 --> 00:15:02,660
Finally, a Chinese police officer.

245
00:15:02,740 --> 00:15:03,340
Hello, sir.

246
00:15:03,420 --> 00:15:04,860
I just wanted to ask,

247
00:15:04,900 --> 00:15:06,620
(Mysterious Disappearance of Shen Diexian)
have these girls been found?

248
00:15:07,860 --> 00:15:09,460
What's your connection to them?

249
00:15:10,500 --> 00:15:11,860
We're like sisters.

250
00:15:12,500 --> 00:15:13,900
We're all from Fourth Road.

251
00:15:13,940 --> 00:15:14,980
You know how it is.

252
00:15:15,340 --> 00:15:17,100
We dance hostesses have our own rules.

253
00:15:17,100 --> 00:15:19,020
We look after our own when they die.

254
00:15:19,020 --> 00:15:19,780
The cases are closed.

255
00:15:19,940 --> 00:15:21,220
They've all been taken home.

256
00:15:21,340 --> 00:15:22,700
Taken home? By whom?

257
00:15:22,740 --> 00:15:24,540
Are you questioning
what the police said?

258
00:15:24,700 --> 00:15:25,620
Nobody you're looking for is here.

259
00:15:25,620 --> 00:15:26,740
- No...
- Come on, leave.

260
00:15:26,740 --> 00:15:27,900
That's not what I meant.

261
00:15:28,220 --> 00:15:29,940
Wait, officer!

262
00:15:29,940 --> 00:15:31,420
Are you questioning the police?

263
00:15:31,540 --> 00:15:32,340
No!

264
00:15:32,660 --> 00:15:33,580
That's not it.

265
00:15:43,220 --> 00:15:45,380
Since you've agreed to help
Jing Fanshu investigate,

266
00:15:45,500 --> 00:15:46,780
what's the harm

267
00:15:47,020 --> 00:15:47,980
in having another person help?

268
00:15:48,100 --> 00:15:49,540
But your family is safe,

269
00:15:49,900 --> 00:15:51,340
and you have a respectable job now.

270
00:15:51,340 --> 00:15:52,260
Why risk your safety with us?

271
00:15:52,260 --> 00:15:53,620
It's precisely because I have family

272
00:15:53,620 --> 00:15:55,460
that I must see this
investigation through.

273
00:15:55,980 --> 00:15:56,780
Otherwise,

274
00:15:57,620 --> 00:15:59,460
what's the point of being
a detective inspector?

275
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:07,940
All right, then.

276
00:16:09,660 --> 00:16:11,300
For Xiaozhu and Yijie,

277
00:16:11,780 --> 00:16:13,140
let's finish
the investigation they started.

278
00:16:16,620 --> 00:16:17,460
Trust me.

279
00:16:18,500 --> 00:16:19,540
Trust us.

280
00:16:40,660 --> 00:16:42,340
I've read all the newspaper articles.

281
00:16:43,060 --> 00:16:45,020
Only these disappearances and suicides

282
00:16:45,020 --> 00:16:46,580
occurred within this precinct.

283
00:16:47,020 --> 00:16:47,860
As for the other case files,

284
00:16:47,860 --> 00:16:49,060
I don't have access to them yet.

285
00:16:49,660 --> 00:16:50,820
Something is better than nothing.

286
00:16:54,540 --> 00:16:55,740
They barely investigated

287
00:16:55,740 --> 00:16:57,460
before ruling them suicides
and closing the cases.

288
00:16:57,860 --> 00:16:59,220
With things so chaotic these days,

289
00:17:00,100 --> 00:17:02,420
there are countless suicides
and disappearances.

290
00:17:02,900 --> 00:17:04,500
Without pressure from the families,

291
00:17:04,620 --> 00:17:06,500
(My Daughter Chen Yue'e Is Missing)
no one would bother investigating.

292
00:17:06,660 --> 00:17:07,860
I don't think they're
too busy to investigate.

293
00:17:08,060 --> 00:17:09,380
I think they simply don't want to.

294
00:17:10,020 --> 00:17:11,260
Apart from the initial reports,

295
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:12,420
there's nothing about
what happened afterward.

296
00:17:14,060 --> 00:17:16,140
If all these cases are connected,

297
00:17:16,580 --> 00:17:17,380
then

298
00:17:17,500 --> 00:17:18,940
whatever is behind them

299
00:17:19,420 --> 00:17:20,700
must be far bigger than we realize.

300
00:18:18,120 --> 00:18:20,170
He's the detective inspector
who said the cases were closed.

301
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:21,700
Jiang Menhu.

302
00:18:21,860 --> 00:18:23,500
He used to be Boss Ren's enforcer.

303
00:18:23,740 --> 00:18:25,740
Then he was appointed
detective inspector.

304
00:18:27,300 --> 00:18:28,140
Just like you,

305
00:18:28,170 --> 00:18:29,220
he got the job through connections.

306
00:18:32,260 --> 00:18:33,180
Instead of making fun of me,

307
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:34,230
we should catch him.

308
00:18:34,230 --> 00:18:36,840
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

309
00:18:37,390 --> 00:18:40,160
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

310
00:18:40,310 --> 00:18:42,100
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

311
00:18:42,110 --> 00:18:43,680
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

312
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,640
♪But I refuse to fall♪

313
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:50,560
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

314
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:53,120
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

315
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:57,200
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

316
00:18:57,520 --> 00:19:00,360
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

317
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:03,200
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

318
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:06,800
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

319
00:19:06,800 --> 00:19:10,000
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

320
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:14,240
♪Those who have hurt me♪

321
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:17,480
♪I choose to pierce through♪

322
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,560
♪To tear apart♪

323
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:26,560
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

324
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:30,360
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

325
00:19:30,360 --> 00:19:33,280
♪Nor bow to power♪

326
00:19:33,280 --> 00:19:35,560
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

327
00:19:37,360 --> 00:19:41,280
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
